      "description": "Watch Los Angeles FC vs Portland Timbers highlights and goals from Major League Soccer on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 23, 2026. The atmosphere was electric for the MLS clash on August 23, 2026 , as Los Angeles FC hosted the Portland Timbers . Both teams took to the pitch seeking territorial dominance in a match that promised to be decided by tactical discipline and physical endurance. An Early Shock and Forced Adjustments The match ignited almost immediately in favor of the visitors. In just the 4th minute, the Portland Timbers silenced the home crowd when David Da Costa found the back of the net following a precise pass from Kristoffer Velde . This early goal forced LAFC into an immediate pursuit of an equalizer, but the game's rhythm was frequently disrupted by fouls. Mathieu Choiniere saw yellow in the 16th minute, and shortly after, the hosts faced a tactical setback when Timothy Tillman was replaced by Jacob Shaffelburg in the 20th minute due to an early change. Tactical Battle and the Equalizer The second half introduced a flurry of substitutions as both managers looked to tip the scales. While Portland sought to defend their narrow lead, LAFC ramped up the pressure. The home side's persistence finally paid off in the 79th minute. Assisted by Jude Terry , the talismanic Denis Bouanga clinical finish brought the score level at 1-1, re-energizing the stadium. The goal was a just reward for Los Angeles' offensive efforts as they refused to let the game slip away in front of their fans. Stoppage Time Drama and a Red Card The closing stages were defined by high tension and disciplinary issues. Denis Bouanga received a yellow card in the 87th minute, followed closely by Portland's Vincent Janssen in the 89th. However, Janssen's night ended prematurely in stoppage time; in the 90+3rd minute, he was shown a second yellow card and sent off. Despite the late man advantage for LAFC , the 1-1 scoreline held firm until the final whistle at 90+6, concluding a fiercely contested battle in the City of Angels."
